WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.580 --> 00:00:01.820
Well, the time has come.

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:05.540
Pauley Perrette's Abby Sciuto has now left
the NCIS team.

00:00:05.740 --> 00:00:10.520
On May 8th's episode, Abby finally decided
to pack her bags and head off to start a new

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:15.410
life in London after enduring a gunshot wound
and facing down the person responsible for

00:00:15.410 --> 00:00:16.620
her attack all alone.

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:20.980
Fans have been bracing for the character's
exit for months, and yet, it's still a little

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:23.420
hard to accept that her time on the show is
through.

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:28.240
There've been a lot of rumors surrounding
Pauley Perrette's decision to leave NCIS after

00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:32.140
15 seasons, but the actor is doing her best
to dispel all of them.

00:00:32.490 --> 00:00:37.020
When Perette first announced in October of
2017 that she'd be giving up her long-lived

00:00:37.020 --> 00:00:42.130
role as Abby, the team's intelligent and eccentric
forensic specialist, fans wondered why she

00:00:42.130 --> 00:00:46.149
might step away from the career-making role
after spending so many years in those Doc

00:00:46.149 --> 00:00:46.649
Martens.

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.100
False rumors swirled that she was going to
become a spokeswoman for a skincare line,

00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:53.200
but Perrette shot that story down right away.

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:55.170
"And I'm like 'What is going on?'"

00:00:55.170 --> 00:00:59.080
In a note to fans, the actress confirmed her
exit but denied the cosmetic connection, by

00:00:59.080 --> 00:00:59.920
writing:

00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:04.620
"So, it is true that I am leaving NCIS after
this season.

00:01:04.629 --> 00:01:09.750
There have been all kinds of false stories
as to why (NO I DON'T HAVE A SKIN CARE LINE

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:12.560
AND NO MY NETWORK AND SHOW ARE NOT MAD AT
ME!)."

00:01:13.149 --> 00:01:17.460
That might've cleared some of the bizarre
rumors about her decision to leave -- after

00:01:17.469 --> 00:01:21.360
all, she's certainly not the first actor to
leave a hit series to pursue other projects

00:01:21.360 --> 00:01:23.480
-- but the speculation still continued.

00:01:23.860 --> 00:01:27.760
This time, buzz suggested that trouble had
been brewing behind the scenes and that the

00:01:27.760 --> 00:01:29.240
actress could no longer tolerate it.

00:01:29.480 --> 00:01:32.860
However, it's since become clear that Perrette
departed on good terms.

00:01:32.860 --> 00:01:37.860
NCIS executive producers George Schenck and
Frank Cardea told Variety that they had "known

00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:42.619
for some time" that season 15 of the series
would be Perrette's last, and that everyone

00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:45.500
involved on the show wanted to give her a
memorable send-off.

00:01:45.560 --> 00:01:47.120
The pair said in a joint statement:

00:01:47.560 --> 00:01:52.060
"From day one, she has brought incredible
passion and specificity to the role.

00:01:52.060 --> 00:01:56.569
Abby is a character that inspires millions
of fans around the world, and all of us at

00:01:56.569 --> 00:01:59.280
NCIS are appreciative of Pauley for portraying
her."

00:01:59.540 --> 00:02:04.309
Perrette herself later spoke up to assure
fans that there wasn't any drama behind her

00:02:04.309 --> 00:02:06.109
departure, as she told TV Insider:

00:02:06.109 --> 00:02:11.349
"I believe in God and the universe so firmly,
and it just suddenly became blindingly apparent

00:02:11.349 --> 00:02:12.420
that now was the time.

00:02:12.760 --> 00:02:17.080
After a lot of thought, I decided to announce
it myself on Twitter because I didn't want

00:02:17.080 --> 00:02:18.940
it to be turned into anything 'shocking.'

00:02:19.220 --> 00:02:22.220
Abby leaving is more than a cheap TV ploy."

00:02:22.420 --> 00:02:27.400
Perrette may be missing from NCIS in the future,
leaving Ducky and Mark Harmon's Leroy Gibbs

00:02:27.400 --> 00:02:32.110
as the only remaining original cast members,
but the mark she left on the series and the

00:02:32.110 --> 00:02:34.720
impact she had on its fans won't soon be forgotten.

00:02:35.120 --> 00:02:38.700
"Abby has been this incredible role model
for young women."

00:02:38.700 --> 00:02:42.780
"Thousands and thousands and thousands of
young women that have been inspired by a television

00:02:42.780 --> 00:02:46.340
character, and now they're truly out there
changing the world."

00:02:46.420 --> 00:02:51.200
So, even though fans have said goodbye to
Abby Sciuto on the show, her cultural impact

00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:52.280
will certainly continue.

